 ("scale", "Another corrosion byproduct is scale, which is made up of deposits on surfaces from the formation of insoluble compounds from normally soluble salts.", CG, 23),
 ("galv", "Galvanic corrosion is the corrosion that results when two dissimilar metals with different potentials are placed in electrical contact in an electrolyte.", CG, 23),
